[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m in a `fork()`ed child and compare the child's termination status (SIGABRT)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m between C and Rust.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
