[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    390[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 7, 8, 9 | Guard-page / canary `sodium_malloc` paths. This build compiles the portable fallback (plain `malloc` + `memset 0xdb`), so these branches do not exist in the binary. |
