[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    395[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 152 | `smlen - 64 > MESSAGEBYTES_MAX` is unreachable: `MESSAGEBYTES_MAX` is `SIZE_MAX - 64`, so no `smlen` satisfies it. |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    396[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 165, 166 | Marked `LCOV_EXCL` in the C: `crypto_kem_mlkem768_dec` never fails and the x25519 half of a derived xwing secret key is never small-order. The surrounding code paths ARE exercised with corrupted and fully random ciphertexts and secret keys, and C and Rust agree on every derived shared secret. |
